## 5. Nginx Configuration for IP Blocking

```nginx
# /etc/nginx/sites-available/default
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name example.com;

    # Deny specific IPs
    deny 192.168.1.100;
    deny 10.0.0.0/24;

    # Allow all others
    allow all;

    location / {
        root /var/www/html;
        index index.html;
    }
}
```

